    <item>
      <title>Book Review: World of Warcraft: Dawn of the Aspects</title>
      <link>https://RapidF5.com/posts/dawn-of-aspects-review/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Jul 2025 12:12:38 -0700</pubDate>
      <guid>https://RapidF5.com/posts/dawn-of-aspects-review/</guid>
      <description>&lt;figure&gt;
    &lt;img loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://RapidF5.com/images/dawn-of-aspects-front.jpeg&#34; width=&#34;30%&#34;/&gt; 
&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Format:&lt;/strong&gt; Audiobook&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://wowpedia.fandom.com/wiki/Dawn_of_the_Aspects&#34;&gt;Wowpedia Dawn of the Aspects Page&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;
&lt;a href=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R-R4NiG2rAE&#34;&gt;Watch the &amp;ldquo;Dawn of the Aspects&amp;rdquo; Supercut on YouTube&lt;/a&gt; — &lt;em&gt;Flying Buttress&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;overall-rating&#34;&gt;Overall Rating&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;★★★★★★★☆☆☆ (7/10)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;heading&#34;&gt;✅&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid narration and audio quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fascinating look into early Azeroth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some intense, well-written action scenes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 id=&#34;heading-1&#34;&gt;❌&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The prologue felt disconnected from the main story&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Similar-sounding voices in the Audible version made some scenes confusing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;thoughts&#34;&gt;Thoughts&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;When I started reading this, I was told it was the best place to begin since it’s set furthest back in Azeroth’s timeline. However, I later found a more helpful reading order: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.reddit.com/r/warcraftlore/comments/16ph4l9/ultimate_guide_to_warcraft_lore_full_reading_and/&#34;&gt;Best Warcraft Lore Order&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
